<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Materials keeps lead price unchanged.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Materials keeps lead price unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Materials Corp said on Monday it would keep its selling price for lead unchanged at 128,000 yen per tonne.</p>
<p>The company periodically reviews its selling prices and changes them in line with market prices and currency rates.</p>
</text>
